DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261021
SUMMARY:County TAT payment due for July to September 2026 (HCTAT)
DESCRIPTION:Pay the County of Hawaiʻi its 3% TAT for July to September 202
 6. There's no county return\, just the payment.\nhttps://tat.ehawaii.gov/t
 at/hawaii/\nThe county's payment site charges $2.50 per payment\, plus $1 
 by eCheck or 2.5% by card.\n\nFrom hawaiirentaltax.com. Rules checked Octo
 ber 1\, 2026. This is general information\, not tax advice.
URL:https://hawaiirentaltax.com/
